ufacturing", "Fermentation", "Biotech", "Training"], "long_description": "# Train Smarter, Not Harder\nWhether you're preparing college students for a biomanufacturing job or onboarding employees in a lab, BioSuite Virtual removes common barriers\u2014limited equipment, instructor bandwidth, safety risks\u2014and replaces them with scalable, immersive learning.\n- No Lab Equipment, No Waste, No Risk\n- Scalable & Self-Paced\n- Always Available, Always Repeatable\n- Informed by Industry\n- Performance Tracking  \n# BioSuite Virtual Key Features\nBuilt for realism and interaction, BioSuite Virtual offers an unmatched simulation of real-world lab experiences\u2014without the capital investment and overhead. Users gain competence and confidence before using real equipment.\n- Realistic Lab Environments \n- Hands-On Assembly Tasks \n- Interactive Control Unit \n- Repeatable Practice Modules \n- Virtual Safety Protocols\u200b\u200b\n- Learning Management System Integration\n# Learning Design That Drives Results\nGrounded in proven learning science, BioSuite Virtual ensures that trainees not only understand how to perform tasks, but why they matter.\n- Step-by-Step Guidance\n- In-Depth Animations\n- Contextual Prompts\n- Knowledge Checks\n- Virtual Demonstrations", "short_description": "BioSuite Virtual is high-fidelity, self-paced training for tomorrow\u2019s biomanufacturing workforce that blends cutting-edge Mixed Reality immersion, intuitive interface design, and proven learning design. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://biosuitevirtual.com/privacy/biosuite-virtual", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Prism Immersive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://biosuitevirtual.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "47808930179